            "sid": "1SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Daudi iri daqáy amór Saulo, iri sihhiít dír geeraawós, guri sagadiyuús. Saulo guri waatlakweés kángw kilá' wá alé, guri tsawaár tawa heé xooslaarós ar slaqwara ga amohhe'eemiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
